          ai: "Game: Albastini. Type: Point-trick. Deck: 36 cards (A=11, 7=10, K=4, J=3, Q=2). Rule: NO follow-suit requirement. Strategy: Sacrifice low cards in 'Otea' phase, save A/7 for winning rounds.",
